# Claude Code — gitignore template
#
# Copy these lines into your project's .gitignore
# to properly separate shared config from personal config.
#
# ── COMMIT these (shared with team) ──
# .claude/settings.json       → hooks, MCP servers, permissions
# .claude/commands/            → slash commands
# .claude/skills/              → project skills
# .claude/agents/              → custom agents
# .claude/rules/               → team standards
# CLAUDE.md                    → project configuration
#
# ── IGNORE these (personal) ──

# Personal overrides (API keys, model preferences, local MCP servers)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Claude's auto-generated memory from your sessions
.claude/auto-memory/

# Claude session data
.claude/todos.md
.claude/analytics/
